From: VTB Project <vtb@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] uvcsink: allocate the event watcher an unused fd

dup3(device_fd, device_fd + 1, O_CLOEXEC) replaces an open descriptor
when the neighboring number is occupied. In the Live2D pipeline it
replaces one of the RGA output pool's DMA-BUF descriptors with the UVC
device. Allocate an unused descriptor and set close-on-exec atomically.

--- a/sys/uvcgadget/gstuvcsink.c
+++ b/sys/uvcgadget/gstuvcsink.c
@@ -855,7 +855,7 @@ gst_uvc_sink_watch (GstUvcSink * self)
 
   g_object_get (G_OBJECT (self->v4l2sink), "device-fd", &device_fd, NULL);
 
-  fd = dup3 (device_fd, device_fd + 1, O_CLOEXEC);
+  fd = fcntl (device_fd, F_DUPFD_CLOEXEC, 0);
   if (fd < 0)
     return FALSE;
 
